{"candidateAnswer":"It motivates others to learn about car mechanics","evidence":"[D28:10 | 5:46 pm on 2 November, 2023] Dave: Thanks, Calvin! It's awesome people are checking out my blog and asking me for advice. I recently posted about how I made this car look like a beast, and it was great to hear it inspired others to start their own DIY projects.","itemId":"urn:uuid:a69a1704-7ce9-5e2a-aaea-f650db68c5cf","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:a36dd4631889ee119aa3291e1e1cb103735c7dcf34301294881e5b5e94937c0b","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What kind of impact does Dave's blog on car mods have on people?","referenceAnswer":"It inspires others to start their DIY projects","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"a36dd4631889ee119aa3291e1e1cb103735c7dcf34301294881e5b5e94937c0b"}}]}